wh40k-footfall-bar-lostsockresident-name = resident looking for a sock
wh40k-footfall-bar-lostsockresident-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-lostsockresident-marker = Footfall: resident looking for a sock (LostSockResident)
wh40k-footfall-bar-lostsockresident-chat = Two socks went into the laundry. One came back. I suspect the other has been promoted.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerone-name = dining room patron
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerone-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerone-marker = Footfall: dining room patron (DinerOne)
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerone-chat = The soup is good. I asked what was in it, and the chef wished me a pleasant meal. Very diplomatic.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinertwo-name = dining room patron
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinertwo-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinertwo-marker = Footfall: dining room patron (DinerTwo)
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinertwo-chat = My ration card says one portion. It says nothing about the size of the portion. I admire that flexibility.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerthree-name = dining room patron
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerthree-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerthree-marker = Footfall: dining room patron (DinerThree)
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerthree-chat = I crossed three sectors for work. Turns out the best discovery was a kitchen that salts its potatoes.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerfour-name = dining room patron
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerfour-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerfour-marker = Footfall: dining room patron (DinerFour)
wh40k-footfall-bar-dinerfour-chat = I ordered something light. The plate is light. We are making progress.
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcookone-name = junior cook
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcookone-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcookone-marker = Footfall: junior cook (JuniorCookOne)
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcookone-chat = The chef says to taste as I cook. At this rate there will be very little left to serve.
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcooktwo-name = junior cook
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcooktwo-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcooktwo-marker = Footfall: junior cook (JuniorCookTwo)
wh40k-footfall-bar-juniorcooktwo-chat = That is not burnt. It is a crust. A rather committed crust.
wh40k-footfall-bar-barjanitor-name = janitor
wh40k-footfall-bar-barjanitor-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-barjanitor-marker = Footfall: janitor (BarJanitor)
wh40k-footfall-bar-barjanitor-chat = The floor is clean. Please enjoy this rare moment before somebody brings in the rest of Footfall on their boots.
wh40k-footfall-bar-diningcorridorresident-name = resident outside the dining room
wh40k-footfall-bar-diningcorridorresident-desc = A familiar face in this corner of Footfall.
wh40k-footfall-bar-diningcorridorresident-marker = Footfall: resident outside the dining room (DiningCorridorResident)
wh40k-footfall-bar-diningcorridorresident-chat = I came to read the menu. Strictly research. The smell of dinner has no influence on my findings.
wh40k-footfall-bar-marker-desc = The arrow previews spawn facing. Place seated sources on their intended chair's tile; exact centre alignment is unnecessary. Save before map initialization.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-name = Ivo Mercer
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-desc = The bartender serving Footfall residents.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-marker = Footfall: Ivo Mercer (bartender)
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-title = Ivo Mercer — bartender
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-intro = Welcome. If you have had a long day, I have a short menu. Pick your remedy.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-menu = What shall it be? Something strong, something sweet, or water with no questions asked?
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-info = Beer, wine, whisky, vodka, rum and gin. Cola and water too. Even out here, every evening does not have to end in a story.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-banter = I listen for free. Drinks cost money. Confusing those two has ruined several promising bars.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ivomercer-farewell = Take care. If the corridor starts swaying, the kitchen has something more substantial.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-name = Bastian Rook
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-desc = The head chef serving Footfall residents.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-marker = Footfall: Bastian Rook (head chef)
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-title = Bastian Rook — head chef
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-intro = Come in while it is hot. A decent meal cannot fix your whole shift, but it can improve the next half hour.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-menu = Hungry? The menu is here. There is no exam at the end; just choose something you like.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-info = Burgers, fries, loaded potatoes, eggs Benedict, tomato soup, a slice of pizza and a plain doughnut. Ordinary food. Sometimes that is exactly what a person needs.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-banter = The hat makes me look in charge. The cooks know who actually keeps this kitchen running. I pay them in compliments and try not to burn the soup.
wh40k-footfall-bar-bastianrook-farewell = Eat well. And if you liked it, tell the cooks. They hear enough about everything that goes wrong.
wh40k-footfall-bar-ask-menu = What is on the menu?
wh40k-footfall-bar-small-talk = How is the shift going?
